TcTypeConstant.description:
Default effectivity carry over options for Item realization,based on these values the user interface checkbox(  sync effectivity from source assembly) in item realization dialog can be hidden, enabled or disabled , check or uncheck  by default. These values will  be honored only for realization create and NOT for update.  Possible values are ;0 for Invisible and not selected; 
1 for Invisible and Selected;
2 for Visible and not selected;
3 for Visible and Selected;
4 for Visible , Selected and Disabled.

Default variant carry over options for Item realization,based on these values the user interface checkbox (  sync  variant expressions from source assembly) in item realization dialog can be hidden, enabled or disabled , check or uncheck  by default. These values will  be honored only for realization create and NOT for update.  Possible values are ;
0 for Invisible and not selected;
1 for Invisible and Selected;
2 for Visible and not selected;
3 for Visible and Selected;
4 for Visible , Selected and Disabled.
